SUMMARY:Sav-On Wine Tasting - Missouri
DESCRIPTION:A Taste of Sonoma: The Gundlach Bundschu Experience \nWe’re bringing a taste of Sonoma to Chesterfield! Join Gundlach Bundschu’s National Sales Director at Sav-On Liquor & Wine for an evening of wine\, stories and more than 160 years of winemaking heritage. Explore a selection of Gundlach Bundschu wines with light appetizers and discover the people and place behind every bottle. \nWednesday\, November 4\, 2026 | 6–7 p.m.\nSav-On Chesterfield\n17397 Chesterfield Airport Rd.\, Chesterfield\, MO 63005 \n$10 per person\, plus fees. Must be 21 or older to attend.
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/hamilton-wine-dinner-3/
CATEGORIES:Wine Tasting,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/GB-Events-Page-Banner-17.png
