SUMMARY:Lombardi Food & Wine Festival (Milwaukee) with Hernan Valverde
DESCRIPTION:2026 Food & Wine Experience\nThe Pfister Hotel | Milwaukee\, WI \nMilwaukee\, we’re coming your way. Join Hernan Valverde of Gundlach Bundschu at the 2026 Food & Wine Experience for an evening of great pours\, delicious bites\, and a good cause. \nStop by our table for a taste of Sonoma\, then explore offerings from Milwaukee’s favorite restaurants\, breweries\, and wineries from across the country. With live music\, a wine pull\, and a silent auction\, the evening brings plenty to enjoy while supporting cancer research and treatment. \nGeneral Admission: $150 | VIP Experience: $200\nAges 21+ \nGet Tickets
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/hamilton-wine-dinner/
CATEGORIES:Wine Tasting,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/vlcf-fw-2024.png
END:VEVENT
