SUMMARY:Sonoma Organic Regenerative Biodynamic Educational Tasting (SORBET)
DESCRIPTION:Experience the premier wine tasting of SORBET with 20+ Sonoma Valley winegrowers and producers at Fort Mason’s Gallery 308 on November 8th. \n\n\n\n\nJoin 20+ Sonoma Valley winegrowers and producers at Fort Mason’s Gallery 308 on November 8th\, 2026 for an unforgettable afternoon of progressive farming practices and wine tasting. With over 2000 acres of Sonoma Valley vineyards now dedicated to organic\, biodynamic\, or regenerative practices\, the Sonoma stands at the forefront of progressive winegrowing on a global scale. \nThe first ever Sonoma Organic Regenerative Biodynamic Educational Tasting (aka S.O.R.B.E.T.) offers attendees the opportunity to taste with producers and learn more about the future-focused farming techniques that have become synonymous with the world-class wines of Sonoma Valley. \nDiscount tickets available with the code ICYSORBET ($15 Discount) \nGET TICKETS \n\n\nGallery 308\n\n2 Marina Boulevard \nSan Francisco\, CA 94123
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/sorbet-tasting-2026/
CATEGORIES:Wine Tasting,GB on the Road,National
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-29-at-9.12.12-AM.png
END:VEVENT
