SUMMARY:Gundlach BundSHOW Winter Club Virtual Tasting
DESCRIPTION:Gundlach BundSHOW Winter Club Virtual Tasting\nJoin us this Thursday November 19th\, @ 5pm PT for our Fall Bacchus Club Virtual Tasting\, The Gundlach BundSHOW! Hosted by our Winemaker Connor Bockman and other special guests. This 1-Hour event will be held on Zoom from the comfort of your own home. This is a great opportunity to get to know the wines in your latest club shipment\, ask those wine questions you’ve been thinking about and cheers with members from across the country.\nWe will be drinking through selections from the club shipment. There will be trivia for a chance to win prizes and more!\nRESERVE YOUR SPOT
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/gundlach-bundshow-fall-vt-2/
CATEGORIES:GB on the Road,National,Bacchus Club
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/gif:https://www.gunbun.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/GB-Events-Page-Banner.gif
END:VEVENT
