SUMMARY:Aprés Ski Holiday Party
DESCRIPTION:APRÉS SKI HOLIDAY PARTY \nJoin us for a cozy aprés ski themed party at Gundlach Bundschu\, where friends\, family\, and neighbors come together to sip\, shop\, and share in the spirit of the holidays and our club community. \nWe’ll be pouring a few special bottles pulled from the family cellar\, enjoying festive snacks\, and visiting with members of the Bundschu family throughout the day. You’ll also find exclusive opportunities to stock up for the holidays\, with limited offers and cheerful surprises you won’t want to miss. And who knows — there might even be a few reindeer games along the way. \nSo bundle up (dress in your favorite aprés ski gear)\, bring your favorite people\, and come raise a glass to a little Bundschu cheer. \nDATE: Sunday December 6th \nTIME: Noon-4 (Choose between 12-2 and 2-4) \nLOCATION: Gundlach Bundschu Winery Tasting Room & Courtyard \nGET TICKETS Club members receive two (2) free tickets per membership. Additional tickets are $45pp. Guests under 21 are free to attend.
URL:https://www.gunbun.com/event/apres-ski-holiday-party/
LOCATION:Gundlach Bundschu Winery\, 2000 Denmark St\, Sonoma\, 95476\, United States
CATEGORIES:Winery Event,Local
